WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.299
Three o'clock.

00:00:01.295 --> 00:00:02.553
A line of cars.

00:00:02.584 --> 00:00:04.306
A parent watching the clock.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:07.348
And a school office trying to answer: Who's here?

00:00:07.274 --> 00:00:08.416
Who's picking up?

00:00:08.412 --> 00:00:10.134
Which child is staying late?

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.572
Outside, a teacher keeps the line moving.

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:14.524
In the rain.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:15.522
In the cold.

00:00:15.553 --> 00:00:17.032
In the afternoon sun.

00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:20.062
They deserve better tools, and a little less shouting across the

00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:20.956
parking lot.

00:00:21.963 --> 00:00:23.372
Does this sound familiar?

00:00:24.763 --> 00:00:26.113
Meet DismissalCue.

00:00:26.806 --> 00:00:29.817
We're building a calmer, more connected way to get every school

00:00:29.755 --> 00:00:30.595
day home.

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:35.943
Imagine one check-in for eligible siblings, approved pickup permissions,

00:00:35.892 --> 00:00:37.626
and clear calls to staff.

00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:40.598
Your school stays in charge of the physical handoff.

00:00:41.597 --> 00:00:43.005
School-set schedules.

00:00:43.129 --> 00:00:44.654
Local Ramadan timing.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:48.149
After-school clubs on the right days, for the right child.

00:00:48.354 --> 00:00:50.796
A later pickup shouldn't come as a surprise.

00:00:51.797 --> 00:00:53.728
Clear updates for families.

00:00:53.817 --> 00:00:55.667
A shared view for staff.

00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:59.487
And school-specific help when an account or a pickup needs attention.

00:01:00.497 --> 00:01:01.603
Less guesswork.

00:01:01.692 --> 00:01:03.113
Better coordination.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.969
More support for the people who care for our children.

00:01:06.963 --> 00:01:08.685
It's time for a better pickup.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:12.621
Talk to your school, district, or school board about DismissalCue.

00:01:12.826 --> 00:01:15.663
Help bring a calmer dismissal to your community.
